OL,3,GYorkshire & Humber
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FCloudy and
OL,6,Fmostly dry evening, but with the odd
OL,7,Fshower continuing to move across the
OL,8,FPennines. Some clearer spells are
OL,9,Flikely after midnight, but still a few
OL,10,Fshowers around. Winds easing overnight.
OL,11,
OL,12,CFriday:FA largely fine and dry day,
OL,13,Fwith any overnight showers soon
OL,14,Feasing. Occasional sunny spells are
OL,15,Flikely, although some cloud will build
OL,16,Fthrough the day.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
