OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Saturday to Monday:FLargely
OL,6,Fdry and feeling warm, with some hazy
OL,7,Fsunny spells Saturday. Cloudier, but
OL,8,Fstaying warm Sunday. Some rain perhaps
OL,9,Fdeveloping overnight into Monday,
OL,10,Fbefore clearing to sunny spells later.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
